// codebox_real.gen -- f_wave_field stage 6: the real-space stage on the inverse-DFT result.
// 256x256 float32. Mirror: tests/modules/wave_field/wave_field_mirror.real_stage().
//
// Inputs: first = the inverse DFT (R = u, B = v), second = the force texture (cold; the module inlet through
// vs_inState), third = last frame's state from the hold stage (cold). Output = the new solver state and the
// feedback edge:  R = u, B = v, G = strike counter, A = 1 + exciter phase.
//   - force (FR-007): v += force * 2 (tex - 0.5) * dt, times src_force, the connected flag from vs_inState (an
//     unconnected inlet is vs_black = 0, which would decode to a full -1 force). The flag lags ~180 ms at load;
//     a uniform force only feeds the DC bin, which the spec stage removes
//   - exciter (FR-008): v += amplitude * 165 (EX_GAIN) * sin(exphase) * gaussian(exc_x, exc_y, sigma 0.02) * dt on
//     the wrapped distance. The phase accumulator lives in A of the state: A = 1 + phase, so a fresh hold
//     texture (A = 1) starts at phase 0; each frame adds 2 pi frequency dt, modulo 2 pi
//   - strike (FR-009): u += 4 (STRIKE_AMP) * gaussian, exactly once per change of the counter strike_id. G of
//     the hold texture remembers the last counter value seen, so the pulse cannot repeat or be dropped
//     whatever the draw order. While reset_gate is on the strike waits (reset, then strike on the same frame
//     is the spec's struck_state) and G keeps its old value
//   - sponge (FR-010): exp(-rate dt) on u and v, rate = edge_amt * 20 (SPONGE_RATE) * smoothstep profile over the
//     border band of width 0.12 (SPONGE_WIDTH). edge 0 leaves the periodic wrap
//   - containment: non-finite / huge values zapped to 0 (abs(x) < 1e30), then clamped to +-100 (U_CAP)
//   - Param names: `exc_x`, `exc_y` (never a one-letter name, `t` was silently never applied) and `edge_amt` (`edge` is
//     a Gen operator name; the dial and the message keep the plain word `edge`)
Param dt(0.016666667);
Param force(1);
Param src_force(0);
Param exc_x(0.5);
Param exc_y(0.5);
Param frequency(2);
Param amplitude(0.5);
Param edge_amt(0);
Param strike_id(0);
Param reset_gate(0);

dx = norm.x - exc_x;
dy = norm.y - exc_y;
dx = dx - floor(dx + 0.5);
dy = dy - floor(dy + 0.5);
prof = exp(0 - (dx * dx + dy * dy) / 0.0008);

lastid = nearest(in3, norm).y;
lastid = switch(abs(lastid) < 1e30, lastid, 0);
exphase = nearest(in3, norm).w - 1;
exphase = switch(abs(exphase) < 1e30, exphase, 0);

uu = nearest(in1, norm).x;
vv = nearest(in1, norm).z;

ff = force * 2 * (nearest(in2, norm).x - 0.5) * src_force + amplitude * 165 * sin(exphase) * prof;
vv = vv + ff * dt;

fire = switch(strike_id != lastid, 1, 0) * switch(reset_gate < 0.5, 1, 0);
uu = uu + fire * 4 * prof;

edist = min(min(norm.x, 1 - norm.x), min(norm.y, 1 - norm.y));
sp = clamp(1 - edist / 0.12, 0, 1);
sprate = edge_amt * 20 * sp * sp * (3 - 2 * sp);
gs = exp(0 - sprate * dt);
uu = uu * gs;
vv = vv * gs;

uu = switch(abs(uu) < 1e30, uu, 0);
vv = switch(abs(vv) < 1e30, vv, 0);
uu = clamp(uu, -100, 100);
vv = clamp(vv, -100, 100);

newid = switch(reset_gate >= 0.5, lastid, strike_id);
newphase = mod(exphase + twopi * frequency * dt, twopi);

out1 = vec(uu, newid, vv, 1 + newphase);
